+  // --- Hodos farbling (C3) -------------------------------------------------
+  // This is the single funnel for BOTH getImageData overloads and for
+  // CanvasRenderingContext2D::getImageDataInternal, which delegates up to it --
+  // and it is also the path an OffscreenCanvas in a worker takes. That last part
+  // is the whole point: the injected JavaScript this replaces ran from
+  // OnContextCreated, which never fires for workers at all, so window and worker
+  // disagreed on every canvas read. One hook here closes that mismatch.
+  //
+  // `image_data` was allocated by ValidateAndCreate above and is not shared with
+  // the canvas's backing store, so perturbing it in place cannot mutate the
+  // canvas.
+  //
+  // The small-canvas gate lives HERE, at the call site, because only the caller
+  // knows the requested surface size. The bound matches the JavaScript this
+  // replaces exactly (`data.width * data.height < 65536`); int64 because sw*sh is
+  // attacker-chosen and would otherwise overflow int.
